		<IRequirement type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID bfccabbc-1e12-4192-ac89-0f3a09d30419</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">Timeliness</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">12.29.2024::15:4:56</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">12.29.2024::15:4:56</_modifiedTime>
			<_body type="a">{\rtf1\fbidis\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}%0D
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\ltrpar\fs20 The system shall collect, process, and disseminate alerts within a maximum latency of 2 minutes from the initial detection of a disaster event.\par%0D
}%0D
</_body>
			<reqID type="a">NFR5</reqID>
		</IRequirement>
		<IRequirement type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID b372cde7-22b6-47aa-b004-d47ba2f2eff4</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">Accuracy</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">12.29.2024::15:2:17</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">12.29.2024::15:2:17</_modifiedTime>
			<_body type="a">{\rtf1\fbidis\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}%0D
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\ltrpar\fs20 The system shall provide a minimum of 95%25 precision in detecting and disseminating alerts for natural disasters, ensuring minimal false positives and negatives.\par%0D
}%0D
</_body>
			<reqID type="a">NFR1</reqID>
		</IRequirement>
		<IRequirement type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID c7917324-3442-41f7-ab32-46e6784e7426</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">Reliability</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">12.29.2024::15:3:39</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">12.29.2024::15:3:39</_modifiedTime>
			<_body type="a">{\rtf1\fbidis\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}%0D
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\ltrpar\fs20 The system shall achieve 99.9%25 uptime, ensuring consistent operation during disaster events, and shall recover from failures within 5 minutes.\par%0D
}%0D
</_body>
			<reqID type="a">NFR3</reqID>
		</IRequirement>
		<IRequirement type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID 1e3844d8-d55f-4f8b-ba4c-6cf720fff4a6</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">Scalability</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">12.29.2024::15:4:11</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">12.29.2024::15:4:11</_modifiedTime>
			<_body type="a">{\rtf1\fbidis\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}%0D
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\ltrpar\fs20 The system shall handle simultaneous alerts for up to 10 million users across diverse regions without degradation in performance.\par%0D
}%0D
</_body>
			<reqID type="a">NFR4</reqID>
		</IRequirement>
		<IRequirement type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID b5a33a0b-32d4-4ec1-be94-58062ccae7c2</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">Modifiability</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">12.29.2024::15:3:5</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">12.29.2024::15:3:5</_modifiedTime>
			<_body type="a">{\rtf1\fbidis\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}%0D
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\ltrpar\fs20 The system architecture shall support updates to alert dissemination protocols and communication channels with minimal impact on existing functionalities, enabling adaptability to evolving requirements.\par%0D
}%0D
</_body>
